[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2648876605","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102639#issuecomment-2648876605","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102639","id":2648876605,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6d4qY9","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-10T18:19:56Z","updated_at":"2025-02-10T18:19:56Z","body":"Thanks for the report!\n\nI'm able to confirm the issues with a much simpler reproduction project:\n\n```\nfunc _process(_delta: float) -> void:\n\tif not _android_surface_setup:\n\t\tvar android_surface = composition_layer.get_android_surface()\n\t\tif android_surface:\n\t\t\t_android_surface_setup = true\n\n\t\t\tvar color = JavaClassWrapper.wrap('android.graphics.Color')\n\t\t\tvar PaintClass = JavaClassWrapper.wrap('android.graphics.Paint')\n\n\t\t\tvar canvas = android_surface.lockCanvas(null)\n\t\t\tif canvas != null:\n\t\t\t\tvar red = color.rgb(1.0, 0.0, 0.0)\n\t\t\t\tcanvas.drawColor(red)\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tvar paint = PaintClass.Paint()\n\t\t\t\tpaint.setColor(color.rgb(1.0, 1.0, 1.0))\n\t\t\t\tpaint.setTextSize(50)\n\t\t\t\tpaint.setAntiAlias(true)\n\n\t\t\t\tcanvas.drawText(\"Hello, Android!\", 50, 100, paint)\n\n\t\t\tandroid_surface.unlockCanvasAndPost(canvas)\n```\n\nWhen using the OpenGL renderer, the \"Hello, Android!\" text is drawn upside down. However, with the Vulkan mobile renderer, it's draw correctly.\n\nSo, it's something about the OpenXR compositor flipping the content when drawing the composition layer. There is a Meta extension (`XR_FB_composition_layer_image_layout`) that can tell the compositor to flip it, which I haven't tried yet, but it's not ideal given that not all headsets may support it, and this is renderer-specific (don't want to accidentally flip when we don't need to)\n\nI'll keep looking into it!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2648876605/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2649112404","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102639#issuecomment-2649112404","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102639","id":2649112404,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6d5j9U","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-10T20:03:30Z","updated_at":"2025-02-10T20:03:30Z","body":"> When using the OpenGL renderer, the \"Hello, Android!\" text is drawn upside down. However, with the Vulkan mobile renderer, it's drawn correctly.\n\nMy previous tests were with Meta Quest 3.\n\nHowever, I just tested with Pico 4 Ultra, and I get the exact reverse: OpenGL is right-side up, but with the Vulkan mobile render it's drawn upside down. :-/","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2649112404/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2649175604","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102639#issuecomment-2649175604","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102639","id":2649175604,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6d5zY0","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-10T20:35:06Z","updated_at":"2025-02-10T20:35:06Z","body":"I just tested the `XR_FB_composition_layer_image_layout` extension, and, unfortunately, setting the \"vertical flip\" flag just reverses the headset's default behavior. So, it's not useful - you still need to know which headset you're running on in order to set it to the right value.\n\nI'm starting to think we should expose a \"vertical flip\" property on composition layers from the 'godot_openxr_vendors' extension (using `XR_FB_composition_layer_image_layout`) that users can set or not set, depending on which headset they are targeting. It's not ideal, but I don't want to bake checks for specific headsets into Godot itself.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2649175604/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2652128505","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102639#issuecomment-2652128505","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102639","id":2652128505,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eFET5","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-11T21:40:07Z","updated_at":"2025-02-11T21:40:07Z","body":"Ultimately, I think this issue is the result of `XR_KHR_android_surface_swapchain` being under-specified and different vendors all doing different things in their implementations. Hopefully, we can get that fixed eventually in the OpenXR spec.\n\nBut until then, I think the best solution is exposing the \"Vertical flip\" option (from `XR_FB_composition_layer_image_layout`) to developers, which they'll need to use (or not use) depending on which headset and graphics API they are targeting.\n\nSince I don't generally think exposing this option to developers is a good idea (it's something they shouldn't need to worry about), I think this should be done in the 'godot_openxr_vendors' extension rather than Godot. I've just posted PR https://github.com/GodotVR/godot_openxr_vendors/pull/267 which adds this\n\n@m4gr3d @BastiaanOlij: I'd love your thoughts on this!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2652128505/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2662301182","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102639#issuecomment-2662301182","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102639","id":2662301182,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6er33-","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-17T07:47:57Z","updated_at":"2025-02-17T07:47:57Z","body":"@dsnopek I agree, especially with a view that we'd like to get this fixed upstream in OpenXR, I don't think we want to adjust the core API.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2662301182/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2689441741","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102639#issuecomment-2689441741","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102639","id":2689441741,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gTZ_N","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-28T00:48:18Z","updated_at":"2025-02-28T00:49:16Z","body":"Feedback during the XR meeting:\n\nWe want to introduce a tickbox in the vendors plugin as a temporary solution so developers have control over this.\nThen keep the discussion going on the OpenXR side for a proper solution to be added to the OpenXR specification.\n\nWe may introduce either a code snippet or possibly a project setting that makes it easier to get the temporary setting correct for platforms we know the value for.\n\n**Note:** This means this issue is not a blocker for Godot itself, as it will be fixed in our vendors plugin.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2689441741/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2692944270","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102639#issuecomment-2692944270","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102639","id":2692944270,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ggxGO","u